{"data": [{"author_id": "1327359720", "created_at": "2026-11-10T01:08:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119960248274264355"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ULIqjE7Dcp", "end": 307, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/lisaabramowicz1/status/2119960248274264355/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119958102699073536", "start": 284, "url": "https://t.co/ULIqjE7Dcp"}]}, "id": "2119960248274264355", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 37, "impression_count": 32653, "like_count": 462, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 44, "retweet_count": 73}, "text": "The rotation in stocks over the past month has been violent. Nvidia is a good example, losing nearly $1.5 trillion of market value since Oct. 6 while the equal weight S&amp;P 500 gained 4% in the same period. The churn shows either incredible resilience or lack of true capitulation. https://t.co/ULIqjE7Dcp", "url": "https://x.com/lisaabramowicz1/status/2119960248274264355"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-11-10T00:42:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119953845254226206"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/jonimitchell/s…", "end": 76, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/jonimitchell/status/2119853503153852526", "start": 53, "url": "https://t.co/PkTnJg0YQx"}]}, "id": "2119953845254226206", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1894, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119853503153852526", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Masterpiece of an album, one of Mitchell's very best https://t.co/PkTnJg0YQx", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2119953845254226206"}, {"author_id": "917683048782503937", "created_at": "2026-11-10T00:36:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119952393798332848"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Economic Watch: China's consumer prices maintain mild recovery in October-", "display_url": "english.news.cn/20261109/ed83d…", "end": 203, "expanded_url": "https://english.news.cn/20261109/ed83dcec432f4fe3b8864b5f347d9de5/c.html", "start": 180, "status": 200, "title": "Economic Watch: China's consumer prices maintain mild recovery in October", "unwound_url": "https://english.news.cn/20261109/ed83dcec432f4fe3b8864b5f347d9de5/c.html", "url": "https://t.co/9VToquREx7"}]}, "id": "2119952393798332848", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 9625, "like_count": 63, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "China's consumer price inflation was up 0.7 percent year on year in October, and was flat month on month. Given weak consumption so far this year, this doesn’t come as a surprise.\nhttps://t.co/9VToquREx7", "url": "https://x.com/michaelxpettis/status/2119952393798332848"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-10T00:09:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119945389797507450"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/sYTrlDU0wi", "end": 254, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2119945389797507450/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119945382100697088", "start": 231, "url": "https://t.co/sYTrlDU0wi"}, {"display_url": "x.com/ethanbwinter/s…", "end": 278, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ethanbwinter/status/2119923791207989525", "start": 255, "url": "https://t.co/ZribP2br67"}]}, "id": "2119945389797507450", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 103, "impression_count": 35592, "like_count": 281, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 24, "retweet_count": 19}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119923791207989525", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I used to think that there was such a thing as the “real economy” which could be characterized as good or bad, distinct from the subjective perceptions of it. But I increasingly agree Ethan’s Wittgensteinian line of thinking here. https://t.co/sYTrlDU0wi https://t.co/ZribP2br67", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2119945389797507450"}, {"author_id": "499603787", "created_at": "2026-11-09T23:00:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119928187270332723"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 182, "id": "7228682", "start": 171, "username": "WSJopinion"}], "urls": [{"description": "Jensen Huang’s affair with an alleged spy has national-security stakes.", "display_url": "wsj.com/opinion/nvidia…", "end": 208, "expanded_url": "https://www.wsj.com/opinion/nvidia-gets-a-chinese-honeypot-lesson-25b45560?st=Fuyn1W", "images": [{"height": 640, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119928187660509187/JkmiH-1v?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119928187660509187/JkmiH-1v?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 185, "status": 200, "title": "Opinion | Nvidia Gets a Chinese Honeypot Lesson", "unwound_url": "https://www.wsj.com/opinion/nvidia-gets-a-chinese-honeypot-lesson-25b45560?st=Fuyn1W", "url": "https://t.co/ri7gx2GPVQ"}]}, "id": "2119928187270332723", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 6044, "like_count": 28, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "“The Huang affair highlights China’s designs on U.S. chips and holes in U.S. export controls. Closing the holes may be a rare but useful area for bipartisan cooperation.” @WSJopinion \n https://t.co/ri7gx2GPVQ", "url": "https://x.com/Lingling_Wei/status/2119928187270332723"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-09T22:43:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119923741618802919"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/semaforben/sta…", "end": 289, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/semaforben/status/2119906280663929276", "start": 266, "url": "https://t.co/WY1OSd6vtk"}]}, "id": "2119923741618802919", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 50, "impression_count": 49146, "like_count": 619, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 68, "retweet_count": 34}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119906280663929276", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Kinda surprised by how modest the market reaction was today. Here is the crown jewel of the AI ecosystem, both in terms of its technology, and also its ability to finance various partners, and we really have no idea yet about the business/legal/operational fallout. https://t.co/WY1OSd6vtk", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2119923741618802919"}, {"author_id": "733647469305864195", "created_at": "2026-11-09T22:19:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119917820200763552"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/posOgWAwUi", "end": 273, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2119917820200763552/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119917801364221952", "start": 250, "url": "https://t.co/posOgWAwUi"}]}, "id": "2119917820200763552", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 14222, "like_count": 63, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "Scale of East Asia's current trade surplus is stunning --\n\nTaiwan and Korea combined are running a surplus of close to $800b in the recent monthly data.   China, ex gold, is close to $1.8 trillion (with some seasonality and no data for October yet). https://t.co/posOgWAwUi", "url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2119917820200763552"}, {"author_id": "499603787", "created_at": "2026-11-09T21:54:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119911587654103412"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 132, "id": "2318195364", "start": 117, "username": "AmrithRamkumar"}, {"end": 165, "id": "3108351", "start": 161, "username": "WSJ"}], "urls": [{"description": "The board of directors has launched an investigation into reports that the CEO was targeted by a Chinese spy.", "display_url": "wsj.com/tech/jensen-hu…", "end": 156, "expanded_url": "https://www.wsj.com/tech/jensen-huang-doesnt-believe-in-succession-planning-its-become-a-big-risk-for-nvidia-abd9ea9d?st=Y7EUte", "images": [{"height": 640, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119911589398937600/I-pBct_G?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119911589398937600/I-pBct_G?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 133, "status": 200, "title": "Jensen Huang Doesn’t Believe in Succession Planning. It’s Become a Big Risk for Nvidia.", "unwound_url": "https://www.wsj.com/tech/jensen-huang-doesnt-believe-in-succession-planning-its-become-a-big-risk-for-nvidia-abd9ea9d?st=Y7EUte", "url": "https://t.co/oYguWMqqwc"}]}, "id": "2119911587654103412", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 5120, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "Jensen Huang’s singular stature as Nvidia’s key man has become a major risk for the company. Insightful reporting by @AmrithRamkumar https://t.co/oYguWMqqwc via @WSJ", "url": "https://x.com/Lingling_Wei/status/2119911587654103412"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-11-09T21:50:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119910609235963905"], "id": "2119910609235963905", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 48, "impression_count": 31243, "like_count": 138, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 27}, "text": "Nvidia General Counsel Teter looks to be in deep doodoo \"In late summer 2025, Nvidia’s Tim Teter called Commerce Under Secretary Jeffrey Kessler, who oversees US chip export curbs, to ask about the Megaspeed investigation, according to people familiar with the matter.", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2119910609235963905"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-11-09T21:48:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119909957068026030"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 61, "id": "149954544", "start": 46, "username": "MorningConsult"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Vjn5y4u4br", "end": 278, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2119909957068026030/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119909787894996992", "start": 255, "url": "https://t.co/Vjn5y4u4br"}]}, "id": "2119909957068026030", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 4100, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_coun